Package: forestdbh
Type: Project
Title: Forest Diameter Distribution Modelling
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Abiodun", "Oyediran", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "your.email@example.com")
Description: An R pipeline that fits twelve candidate probability
    distributions to tree diameter at breast height (DBH) data by
    maximum likelihood, ranks them with Kolmogorov-Smirnov,
    Anderson-Darling and Cramer-von Mises statistics, and produces
    diagnostic plots and parameter tables.
